WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:08.719
Emmy was doing her homework.

2
00:00:08.720 --> 00:00:13.903
"I have to do a science experiment," she said.

3
00:00:13.904 --> 00:00:19.139
"Make a volcano, Emmy!" Oliver said.

4
00:00:19.140 --> 00:00:23.574
"Volcanoes are boring," Emmy said.

5
00:00:23.575 --> 00:00:28.464
"They're just vinegar and baking soda."

6
00:00:28.465 --> 00:00:32.452
"You could put something else in the volcano," Harry said.

7
00:00:32.453 --> 00:00:35.321
"Like what?" asked Emmy.

8
00:00:35.322 --> 00:00:40.449
"Some kids use ketchup instead of vinegar," Harry said.

9
00:00:40.450 --> 00:00:43.846
"That makes red lava!"

10
00:00:43.847 --> 00:00:48.460
"Cool!" said Emmy.

11
00:00:48.461 --> 00:00:50.954
Aunt Judy looked worried.

12
00:00:50.955 --> 00:00:55.455
"Will it make a mess?" she asked.

13
00:00:55.456 --> 00:00:58.679
"Mom might get mad."

14
00:00:58.680 --> 00:01:03.043
"Mom won't mind!" said Emmy.

15
00:01:03.044 --> 00:01:19.108
"Mom loves science experiments!" said Oliver.

16
00:01:19.109 --> 00:01:24.493
Emmy made a clay mountain.

17
00:01:24.494 --> 00:01:28.140
She made a hole in the top.

18
00:01:28.141 --> 00:01:34.403
Then she mixed ketchup with some soap and water.

19
00:01:34.404 --> 00:01:38.572
Emmy poured the mixture into the volcano.

20
00:01:38.573 --> 00:01:43.809
"Let's put some glitter in too!" she said.

21
00:01:43.810 --> 00:01:49.831
Finally she added baking soda.

22
00:01:49.832 --> 00:01:52.839
Everyone waited.

23
00:01:52.840 --> 00:01:56.033
The volcano steamed.

24
00:01:56.034 --> 00:01:59.985
Then it exploded!

25
00:01:59.986 --> 00:02:03.528
Red lava spilled out of the volcano.

26
00:02:03.529 --> 00:02:06.825
It dripped all over the floor.

27
00:02:06.826 --> 00:02:10.872
Glitter sprayed everywhere.

28
00:02:10.873 --> 00:02:14.885
"That was not boring!" Emmy said.

29
00:02:14.886 --> 00:02:18.211
Oliver clapped.

30
00:02:18.212 --> 00:02:25.279
Harry laughed and laughed.

31
00:02:25.280 --> 00:02:29.421
"What's going on?" someone asked.

32
00:02:29.422 --> 00:02:32.547
Everyone looked up.

33
00:02:32.548 --> 00:02:36.391
Mom stood in the doorway.

34
00:02:36.392 --> 00:02:39.456
She was frowning at the mess.

35
00:02:39.457 --> 00:02:49.628
Aunt Judy gulped.

36
00:02:49.629 --> 00:02:58.003
"We were doing a science experiment!" Emmy said.

37
00:02:58.004 --> 00:03:00.819
She grabbed a sponge.

38
00:03:00.820 --> 00:03:10.099
"But now we're cleaning up!"

